{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search cards"},"description":"Find ordinary and artist cards by artwork, occasion, format or budget. Returns matches with exact design keys and versions, images, orderability, destination prices and next_cursor. Pass destination_country when known; read pricing_destination and cents_by_destination. Basic physical specifications appear once in format_specs; include_specs adds published details. Public browsing needs no account or key. If results is empty, inspect unmet, constraints and pagination before adjusting filters. Pass the selected design key and version to prepare_order.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"artist":{"description":"Published artist name or slug, such as one returned in card.artist. Omit to include all artists and standard cards.","maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"cursor":{"description":"Exact next_cursor from the previous search with the same filters. Omit for the first page; stop when next_cursor is null.","pattern":"^(?:\\d{1,6})?$","type":"string"},"destination_country":{"description":"Recipient country as a two-letter ISO code, such as US or CA. Prices depend on it: US addresses have agent-channel introductory prices and other countries the standard prices. Omit it to see US prices with each format\u2019s other-destination amount listed; the prepared order prices every card by its own recipient address.","pattern":"^[A-Z]{2}$","type":"string"},"format":{"description":"Requested card format. Omit to use a format named in query, or flat_card_in_envelope when no format is requested. Other formats remain listed on each result.","enum":["postcard","flat_card_in_envelope","folded_card_in_envelope"],"type":"string"},"humor":{"description":"Humor filter: none, light or playful selects that reviewed level; funn